'''Imoto''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] added in [[Version 6.9 Update|Version 6.9]] that can be obtained from the daily stamp rewards during the [[Mentori Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 400
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Imoto
|name2 = Imoto CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Imoto CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
The only [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal enemy]] that this Bird is useful against is [[Metal Hippoe]]. Otherwise, it's not useful for anything but [[User Rank]], but it can pretty much be called a better [[Neko Hakase (Special Cat)|Neko Hakase]].

{{Job|Classification = Critter}}

